### Shuttle Boarding and QR Seat Assignment Test

### 1. Register a new student
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/student/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNumber": "20260001",
  "firstName": "Boarding",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "email": "boarding.test@mandela.ac.za",
  "phone": "0812345678",
  "password": "Password123",
  "isFunded": true
}

> {% client.global.set("student_token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Login as the student
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/student/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "boarding.test@mandela.ac.za",
  "password": "Password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("student_token", response.body.token); %}
> {% client.global.set("student_id", response.body.id); %}

### 3. Book a shuttle trip (Assuming Trip ID 1 exists and is a SHUTTLE)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shuttle/book/1
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

> {% client.global.set("booking_id", response.body.bookingId); %}

### 4. Get QR Boarding Token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shuttle/booking/{{booking_id}}/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

> {% 
    client.global.set("qr_token", response.body.qrToken);
    client.global.set("qr_expiry", response.body.expiry);
%}

### 5. Verify and Board (Simulated scan at shuttle entry)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shuttle/board
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qrToken": "{{qr_token}}",
  "bookingId": {{booking_id}},
  "studentId": {{student_id}},
  "expiry": "{{qr_expiry}}"
}

### 6. Search available shuttles (Verification of seat decrement)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/search?departure=Summerstrand&destination=North Campus
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
